      <statement><p>Solve the matrix equation <m>Ax = b</m>, where</p>
<p><me>A = \left[\begin{array}{cc}
-7 \amp 5\cr
-6 \amp 3
\end{array}\right], \quad x = 
\left[
\begin{array}{cc}
 x_1 \\ x_2
\end{array}
\right]
\text{ and } \quad b = \left[\begin{array}{c}
-33\cr
-27
\end{array}\right].</me></p>
<p>The solution is:</p>
<p><m>x_1 =</m> <fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
<p><m>x_2 =</m> <fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0002"/></p>
</statement>
      <answer>
        <p>
          <m>4</m>
        </p>
      </answer>
      <answer>
        <p>
          <m>-1</m>
        </p>
      </answer>
